since 2026-05-28 (#544, aidoku-rs upgrade); upstream is still at v7.

Modifications (2026-11-11, fork v8):
- src/helpers.rs: new fetch_detail() / try_detail_by_pinyin() and a raw-response
  variant with_access_response() of the existing with_access(). When the server
  answers errno 2 ("漫画不存在或已被删除") to a guest detail-by-id request,
  the detail is fetched by pinyin instead (search by title, resolve comic_py
  from the search hit with the same id, then detail_by_pinyin). Genuinely
  missing comics still report the original errno 2 error.
- src/lib.rs: get_manga_update now calls helpers::fetch_detail().
- res/source.json: version 7 -> 8.
No other upstream file was changed. The template (templates/zaimanhua/) is
included unmodified so the path dependency in Cargo.toml resolves unchanged.
